@startuml
[*] --> Ready
Ready -> [*] : System Shutdown

Ready -> ViewingAddress : View Address
ViewingAddress -> Ready : Return to Ready

Ready -> AddingAddress : Add New Address
AddingAddress -> Ready : Return to Ready

Ready -> UpdatingAddress : Update Address
UpdatingAddress -> Ready : Return to Ready

Ready -> SearchingAddress : Search Address
SearchingAddress -> Ready : Return to Ready
@enduml
